{"id": "34490", "title": "姑娘追", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 42, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34490.htm", "intro": "家大业大也是麻烦！害她这未出阁的三小姐还得拨空玩算盘，又引来一只穿锦衣的贪色猪哥，这会受邀上他画舫已是百般不愿，为避免猪蹄扒污玉手，她快快抓刀一划，于是船上贵客将成放水流的女尸，好冷！没想她没死成，却让男人剥光看透，这被她罚面壁的呆子还她清白来！哈，老天爷也和她站同边，落难的她再被他救一次，带回家去供起来，但看他呆得厉害，她不禁为他气急绸伞做死少钱难有闲；担忧灶房米缸夜见底，这餐吃了隔餐没，难道她识货的眼光出了岔，硬想把木头漆漆当金龟……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34490", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2188348.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2188349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2188350.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2188351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2188352.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2188353.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2188354.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2188355.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2188356.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2188357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2188358.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2188359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2188360.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2188361.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2188362.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2188363.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2188364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2188365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2188366.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2188367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2188368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2188369.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2188370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2188371.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2188372.html"